<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26186" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαφαν-ής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ές</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φαίνω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>translucent, transparent,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὕαλος</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				767
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὖρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Aph.</u>
					4.72
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Epid.</u>
				1.26
			</span></i>.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́; ὦτα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Coac.</u>
					188
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑδάτια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					229b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτώνια</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Lys.</u>
					48
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτωνάριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Men.
					727
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				5(1).1390.16
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				21
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>de An.</u>
					418b4
				</span></i>
			,al. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>red-hot,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.9
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				4.73
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				75
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				11
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph.,
				<i>manifest,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τάδ᾽ ἤδη διαφανῆ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>OT</u>
					754
				</span></i>
			; <i>distinct, distinctly seen,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φλέβες</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Epid.</u>
					6.3.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἶδος δ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					544c
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				548c
			</span></i> (
				Sup.
			). Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νῶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					2.65
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>An.</u>
				6.1.24
			</span></i>: 
				Sup.
			
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-έστατα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					37.46
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>conspicuous,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς ἄλλοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					600b
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἰς ἅπαντας ἀνθρώπους ἀρετῇ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ti.</u>
					25b
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Subst.
